n, or organizational change, our global team is ready to help.</span>\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"contact-info__regions\">\n            <div class=\"contact-region\">\n              <p class=\"contact-region__name\">\n                <span data-lang=\"zh\">亚太</span>\n                <span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Asia-Pacific</span>\n              </p>\n              <p class=\"contact-region__email\">apac@evoing.com</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"contact-region\">\n              <p class=\"contact-region__name\">\n                <span data-lang=\"zh\">欧洲、中东与非洲</span>\n                <span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">EMEA</span>\n              </p>\n              <p class=\"contact-region__email\">emea@evoing.com</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"contact-region\">\n              <p class=\"contact-region__name\">\n                <span data-lang=\"zh\">美洲</span>\n                <span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Americas</span>\n              </p>\n              <p class=\"contact-region__email\">amer@evoing.com</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <form class=\"contact-form\" onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); alert('Thank you — our team will reach out shortly.')\">\n          <div class=\"contact-form__row\">\n            <input class=\"contact-form__input\" type=\"text\" required placeholder=\"Name / 姓名\">\n            <input class=\"contact-form__input\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Email / 邮箱\">\n          </div>\n          <input class=\"contact-form__input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Company / 公司\">\n          <select class=\"contact-form__input\">\n            <option value=\"\">\n              <span data-lang=\"zh\">选择感兴趣的能力</span>\n              <span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Select Capability of Interest</span>\n            </option>\n            <option value=\"ai-strategy\">AI Strategy &amp; Transformation</option