< {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"reasoning","id":"deepseek_reasoning","summary":[],"content":["Now I have a clear picture. Let me plan the Round 2 expansion:\n\n**New Data Files:**\n1. `src/data/methodology.json` — 6-step engagement model (Diagnose → Strategize → Prototype → Engineer → Migrate → Realize)\n2. `src/data/service-catalog.json` — detailed offerings per capability with deliverables, stakeholders, time-to-value\n3. `src/data/industry-deep.json` — per-industry pain points, approach, outcomes, case references\n4. `src/data/insights.json` — 10+ bilingual insights with categories, regions, reading time\n5. `src/data/leadership.json` — team/leadership with roles, cities, expertise, languages\n\n**New JS Modules:**\n6. `src/js/insights.js` — insights filtering by category/region\n7. `src/js/contact.js` — contact form validation\n8. `src/js/methodology.js` — step/timeline interaction\n9. `src/js/industry-detail.js` — drill-down interaction\n\n**New CSS:**\n10. `src/css/insights.css` — insights-specific styles\n11. `src/css/methodology.css` — timeline/step styles\n12. `src/css/industry-detail.css` — drill-down styles\n\n**Updated Files:**\n13. `src/index.html` — add methodology section, replace insights/careers placeholders, add leadership section, add service catalog section, add industry detail section, update contact form\n14. `src/css/main.css` — import new CSS files, add new component styles\n15. `src/js/main.js` — add new script imports\n16. `scripts/validate.mjs` — validate new data files, new sections, new interactions\n\nLet me start with the data files, then CSS, then JS, then HTML, then validation."]},"threadId":"019e2ff1-213e-7f10-918e-56ff4313a1e6","turnId":"019e3004-e1ce-7ef2-ba78-b511b980a382","completedAtMs":1778922141468}}
