 \"Peak throughput capacity increased 6–10x\"]\n    },\n    \"caseRefs\": [\"retail-platform-migration\"],\n    \"relatedCaps\": [\"data-intelligence\", \"code-modernization\", \"ai-strategy\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"healthcare\",\n    \"painPoints\": {\n      \"zh\": [\"患者数据跨系统互通困难\", \"AI 辅助诊断的监管审批路径不明确\", \"遗留临床系统改造风险高\", \"数据隐私合规要求严格\"],\n      \"en\": [\"Patient data interoperability across systems\", \"Unclear regulatory pathway for AI-assisted diagnosis\", \"High-risk legacy clinical system modernization\", \"Strict data privacy compliance requirements\"]\n    },\n    \"approach\": {\n      \"zh\": \"以 FHIR 标准推动互操作性，在合规沙箱中验证 AI 模型，采用绞杀者模式渐进式替换遗留临床系统。\",\n      \"en\": \"Drive interoperability with FHIR standards, validate AI models in compliance sandboxes, use strangler-fig pattern for progressive legacy clinical system replacement.\"\n    },\n    \"outcomes\": {\n      \"zh\": [\"跨系统数据共享时间从数天缩短至秒级\", \"AI 诊断第二意见准确率达专家水平\", \"零停机临床系统迁移\"],\n      \"en\": [\"Cross-system data sharing from days to seconds\", \"AI diagnostic second-opinion accuracy at expert level\", \"Zero-downtime clinical system migration\"]\n    },\n    \"caseRefs\": [],\n    \"relatedCaps\": [\"data-intelligence\", \"ai-strategy\", \"code-modernization\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"manufacturing\",\n    \"painPoints\": {\n      \"zh\": [\"OT/IT 融合困难\", \"产线数据采集与实时分析链路长\", \"预测性维护模型落地率低\", \"从职能型到产品型组织的转型阻力大\"],\n      \"en\": [\"OT/IT convergence challenges\", \"Long data-collection-to-analysis pipeline on production lines\", \"Low predictive-maintenance model adoption\", \"Resistance in functional-to-product org transformation\"]\n    },\n    \"approach\": {\n      \"zh\": \"以边缘计算打通 OT/IT，构建数字孪生与预测性维护平台，同时重塑技术组织为产品型结构。\",\n      \"en\": \"Bridge OT/IT with edge computing, build digital twins and predictive maintenance platforms, while reshaping technology org into product-oriented structure.\"\n    },\n    \"outcomes\": {\n      \"zh\": [\"非计划停机减少 25–40%\", \"新产品导入周期缩短 30%\", \"工程师人均产出提升 50%\"],\n      \"en\": [\"Unplanned downtime reduced 25–40%\", \"New product introduction cycle shortened 30%\", \"Engineer per-capita output increased 50%\"]\n    },\n    \"caseRefs\": [\"manufacturing-operating-model\"],\n    \"relatedCaps\": [\"operating-model\", \"data-intelligence\", \"code-modernization\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"energy\",\n    \"painPoints\": {\n      \"zh\": [\"碳中和目标缺乏可量化的技术路径\", \"分布式能源管理复杂度高\", \"遗留 SCADA 系统安全风险\", \"能源交易平台延迟要求苛刻\"],\n      \"en\": [\"Net-zero targets lack quantifiable technical pathways\", \"High complexity in distributed energy management\", \"Legacy SCADA system security risks\", \"Stringent latency requirements for energy trading platforms\"]\n    },\n    \"approach\": {\n      \"zh\": \"以碳排放数据平台为基石，构建能源优化数字孪生，同时升级 SCADA 安全架构并现代化交易系统。\",\n      \"en\": \"Build carbon-emission data platform as foundation, construct energy-optimization digital twins, while upgrading SCADA security and modernizing trading systems.\"\n    },\n    \"outcomes\": {\n      \"zh\": [\"碳排放预测准确率达 95%\", \"可再生能源并网效率提升 20%\", \"交易系统延迟降至亚毫秒级\"],\n      \"en\": [\"Carbon emission forecast accuracy at 95%\", \"Renewable energy grid integration efficiency +20%\", \"Trading system latency reduced to sub-millisecond\"]\n    },\n    \"caseRefs\": [],\n    \"relatedCaps\": [\"data-intelligence\", \"cyber-resilience\", \"code-modernization\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"tmt\",\n    \"painPoints\": {\n      \"zh\": [\"用户增长放缓，ARPU 提升困难\", \"5G/边缘基础设施投资回报不明确\", \"内容推荐与广告系统架构老化\", \"数据隐私法规日益严格\"],\n      \"en\": [\"Slowing user growth with ARPU pressure\", \"Unclear ROI on 5G/edge infrastructure investments\", \"Aging content recommendation and ad-system architecture\", \"Increasingly strict data privacy regulations\"]\n    },\n    \"approach\": {\n      \"zh\": \"以 AI 驱动的内容个性化与广告优化为增长引擎，同时以平台工程降低基础设施单位成本。\",\n      \"en\": \"Use AI-driven content personalization and ad optimization as growth engines, while reducing infrastructure unit costs through platform engineering.\"\n    },\n    \"outcomes\": {\n      \"zh\": [\"用户留存率提升 10–20%\", \"广告 CPM 提升 25%\", \"基础设施单用户成本降低 30%\"],\n      \"en\": [\"User retention lift 10–20%\", \"Ad CPM increase 25%\", \"Per-user infrastructure cost reduced 30%\"]\n    },\n    \"caseRefs\": [],\n    \"relatedCaps\": [\"ai-strategy\", \"code-modernization\", \"strategy-advisory\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"public-sector\",\n    \"painPoints\": {\n      \"zh\": [\"政府采购流程慢，敏捷交付受限\", \"跨部门数据共享的法律与技术障碍\", \"公民数字服务体验远落后于商业标准\", \"网络安全威胁面扩大\"],\n      \"en\": [\"Slow procurement processes limit agile delivery\", \"Legal and technical barriers to cross-agency data sharing\", \"Citizen digital service experience lags far behind commercial standards\", \"Expanding cybersecurity threat surface\"]\n    },\n    \"approach\": {\n      \"zh\": \"采用政府科技敏捷框架，以小规模快速交付建立信任，逐步扩大数字服务平台覆盖范围。\",\n      \"en\": \"Adopt gov-tech agile frameworks, build trust through small-scale rapid delivery, progressively expand digital service platform coverage.\"\n    },\n    \"outcomes\": {\n      \"zh\": [\"服务上线时间从年缩短至季度\", \"公民满意度提升 30 个百分点\", \"安全事件检测时间缩短 80%\"],\n      \"en\": [\"Service launch timeline from years to quarters\", \"Citizen satisfaction lift of 30 percentage points\", \"Security incident detection time reduced 80%\"]\n    },\n    \"caseRefs\": [],\n    \"relatedCaps\": [\"strategy-advisory\", \"code-modernization\", \"cyber-resilience\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"automotive\",\n    \"painPoints\": {\n      \"zh\": [\"软件定义汽车带来全新架构挑战\", \"OTA 更新与功能安全合规矛盾\", \"车联网数据量爆炸但变现困难\", \"传统制造思维与软件文化冲突\"],\n      \"en\": [\"Software-defined vehicle creates new architecture challenges\", \"OTA updates conflict with functional safety compliance\", \"Exploding vehicle telemetry data but difficult to monetize\", \"Traditional manufacturing mindset clashes with software culture\"]\n    },\n    \"approach\": {\n      \"zh\": \"以软件定义汽车参考架构为起点，建立安全合规的 OTA 流水线，同时帮助组织培养软件文化。\",\n      \"en\": \"Start with SDV reference architecture, establish safety-compliant OTA pipelines, while helping the organization cultivate software culture.\"\n    },\n    \"outcomes\": {\n      \"zh\": [\"新功能上市时间缩短 50%\", \"OTA 合规审批从月缩短至天\", \"车联网数据 ARPU 提升 2–3 倍\"],\n      \"en\": [\"Feature time-to-market reduced 50%\", \"OTA compliance approval from months to days\", \"Telematics data ARPU increased 2–3x\"]\n    },\n    \"caseRefs\": [],\n    \"relatedCaps\": [\"operating-model\", \"code-modernization\", \"cyber-resilience\"]\n  }\n]\nENDOFFILE"}],"aggregatedOutput":null,"exitCode":0,"durationMs":0},"threadId":"019e2ff1-213e-7f10-918e-56ff4313a1e6","turnId":"019e3004-e1ce-7ef2-ba78-b511b980a382","completedAtMs":1778922457474}}
< {"method":"item/started","params":{"item":{"type":"commandExecution","id":"call_03_0dTUEl5hvXSABq9wS0iX7009","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > /bench/20260516-163845-evoing-global-site-cache/workspace/src/data/insights.json << 'ENDOFFILE'\n[\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"insight-01\\\",\n    \\\"category\\\": \\\"ai-strategy\\\",\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"global\\\",\n    \\\"readingTime\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"8 分钟\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"8 min\\\" },\n    \\\"title\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"2026 AI 就绪度：从实验到规模化的鸿沟\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"AI Readiness 2026: Bridging the Experiment-to-Scale Gap\\\" },\n    \\\"summary\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"我们的全球调研显示，87% 的企业仍处于 AI 实验阶段。本文分析规模化落地的五大障碍及跨越路径。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Our global survey reveals 87% of enterprises remain in AI experimentation. This article analyzes the five barriers to scaling and the paths across.\\\" },\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-04-15\\\",\n    \\\"authors\\\": [{ \\\"zh\\\": \\\"陈思远\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Siyuan Chen\\\" }, { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Michael Torres\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Michael Torres\\\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"insight-02\\\",\n    \\\"category\\\": \\\"code-modernization\\\",\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"amer\\\",\n    \\\"readingTime\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"6 分钟\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"6 min\\\" },\n    \\\"title\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"平台工程的 ROI：从减负到加速\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Platform Engineering ROI: From Toil Reduction to Acceleration\\\" },\n    \\\"summary\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"基于对 40+ 北美企业的平台工程投资分析，我们量化了 IDP 的三年投资回报率与关键成功因素。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Based on analysis of 40+ North American platform engineering investments, we quantify three-year IDP ROI and key success factors.\\\" },\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-03-28\\\",\n    \\\"authors\\\": [{ \\\"zh\\\": \\\"James Park\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"James Park\\\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"insight-03\\\",\n    \\\"category\\\": \\\"operating-model\\\",\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"apac\\\",\n    \\\"readingTime\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"10 分钟\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"10 min\\\" },\n    \\\"title\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"职能型到产品型：亚洲企业技术组织转型实录\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Functional to Product: Inside Asian Enterprise Tech Org Transformations\\\" },\n    \\\"summary\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"三家亚洲制造业巨头的技术组织重塑案例，详述从职能竖井到产品导向团队的变革路径与经验教训。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Three Asian manufacturing giants' tech org transformations, detailing the path from functional silos to product-oriented teams with lessons learned.\\\" },\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-03-10\\\",\n    \\\"authors\\\": [{ \\\"zh\\\": \\\"王敏\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Min Wang\\\" }, { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"佐藤健一\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Kenichi Sato\\\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"insight-04\\\",\n    \\\"category\\\": \\\"data-intelligence\\\",\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"emea\\\",\n    \\\"readingTime\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"7 分钟\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"7 min\\\" },\n    \\\"title\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"数据网格在金融服务中的实践：不止于架构模式\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Data Mesh in Financial Services: More Than an Architecture Pattern\\\" },\n    \\\"summary\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"数据网格不仅是技术架构，更是组织设计选择。本文以欧洲银行为例，探讨实施中的组织与治理挑战。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Data mesh is not just a technical architecture but an organizational design choice. Using a European bank case study, we explore org and governance challenges.\\\" },\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-02-20\\\",\n    \\\"authors\\\": [{ \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Anna Lindström\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Anna Lindström\\\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"insight-05\\\",\n    \\\"category\\\": \\\"cyber-resilience\\\",\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"global\\\",\n    \\\"readingTime\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"9 分钟\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"9 min\\\" },\n    \\\"title\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"零信任不是产品：构建企业安全韧性的系统方法\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Zero Trust Is Not a Product: A Systems Approach to Enterprise Security Resilience\\\" },\n    \\\"summary\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"零信任常被误解为一套产品组合。本文提出以系统思维构建安全韧性，覆盖身份、网络、应用与数据四层。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Zero trust is often misunderstood as a product suite. This article proposes a systems-thinking approach to building security resilience across identity, network, application, and data layers.\\\" },\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-02-05\\\",\n    \\\"authors\\\": [{ \\\"zh\\\": \\\"David Okonkwo\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"David Okonkwo\\\" }, { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"李浩然\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Haoran Li\\\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"insight-06\\\",\n    \\\"category\\\": \\\"ai-strategy\\\",\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"apac\\\",\n    \\\"readingTime\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"5 分钟\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"5 min\\\" },\n    \\\"title\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"生成式 AI 在中国制造业的落地现状与未来\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Generative AI Adoption in Chinese Manufacturing: Present and Future\\\" },\n    \\\"summary\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"基于 50+ 家中国制造企业的调研，分析 GenAI 在质量检测、工艺优化与知识管理中的实际应用与挑战。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Based on a survey of 50+ Chinese manufacturers, we analyze GenAI applications in quality inspection, process optimization, and knowledge management.\\\" },\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-01-18\\\",\n    \\\"authors\\\": [{ \\\"zh\\\": \\\"张伟\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Wei Zhang\\\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"insight-07\\\",\n    \\\"category\\\": \\\"strategy-advisory\\\",\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"emea\\\",\n    \\\"readingTime\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"12 分钟\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"12 min\\\" },\n    \\\"title\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"2026 全球数字化投资趋势报告\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"2026 Global Digital Investment Trends Report\\\" },\n    \\\"summary\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"年度旗舰报告：覆盖 30 个国家、12 个行业的数字化投资趋势分析，含 AI、云、安全三大赛道的支出预测。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Annual flagship report: digital investment trend analysis across 30 countries and 12 industries, including spending forecasts for AI, cloud, and security.\\\" },\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-01-05\\\",\n    \\\"authors\\\": [{ \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Sarah Mitchell\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Sarah Mitchell\\\" }, { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Rahul Kapoor\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Rahul Kapoor\\\" }, { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"林小燕\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Xiaoyan Lin\\\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"insight-08\\\",\n    \\\"category\\\": \\\"code-modernization\\\",\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"global\\\",\n    \\\"readingTime\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"8 分钟\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"8 min\\\" },\n    \\\"title\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"遗留系统现代化的五种模式及选型指南\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Five Patterns for Legacy Modernization and How to Choose\\\" },\n    \\\"summary\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"从重写到绞杀者，我们根据 100+ 项目经验总结五种现代化模式，并提供基于系统特征的选择决策树。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"From rewrite to strangler fig, we summarize five modernization patterns from 100+ projects and provide a selection decision tree based on system characteristics.\\\" },\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2025-12-10\\\",\n    \\\"authors\\\": [{ \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Thomas Wright\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Thomas Wright\\\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"insight-09\\\",\n    \\\"category\\\": \\\"operating-model\\\",\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"amer\\\",\n    \\\"readingTime\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"7 分钟\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"7 min\\\" },\n    \\\"title\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"工程师体验即产品：技术组织设计的新范式\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Developer Experience as Product: A New Paradigm for Tech Org Design\\\" },\n    \\\"summary\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"将工程师体验视为产品来管理，正在成为吸引和留住顶尖技术人才的关键差异化因素。本文提出 DevEx 产品管理框架。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Treating developer experience as a product is becoming a key differentiator for attracting and retaining top technical talent. This article proposes a DevEx product management framework.\\\" },\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2025-11-22\\\",\n    \\\"authors\\\": [{ \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Emily Chen\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Emily Chen\\\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"insight-10\\\",\n    \\\"category\\\": \\\"data-intelligence\\\",\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"apac\\\",\n    \\\"readingTime\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"6 分钟\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"6 min\\\" },\n    \\\"title\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"从湖到仓：亚太企业数据架构演进路径\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"From Lake to Lakehouse: Data Architecture Evolution in Asia-Pacific\\\" },\n    \\\"summary\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"亚太企业在数据架构上面临独特挑战：多语言数据、跨境合规与混合云。本文提出适配 APAC 的湖仓一体演进策略。\\\", \