码资产、并设计面向未来的运营模式。从上海到纽约，从新加坡到伦敦——我们交付可落地的变革。</span>\n          <span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Evoing is a global business consultancy. We help the world'\"'s leading enterprises reshape strategy, modernize code assets, and design future-ready operating models in the AI era. From Shanghai to New York, Singapore to London — we deliver change that sticks.</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\\\"hero__actions\\\">\n          <a href=\\\"#capabilities\\\" class=\\\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\\\" data-target=\\\"capabilities\\\">\n            <span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">了解我们的能力</span>\n            <span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Explore Capabilities</span>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\\\"#contact\\\" class=\\\"btn btn--outline-inverse btn--lg\\\" data-target=\\\"contact\\\">\n            <span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">联系我们</span>\n            <span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Get in Touch</span>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <\"'!-- ========== STATS BANNER ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section--alt\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"stats-banner\">\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <div class=\"stat-item__value\">500+</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-item__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全球顾问</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Global Consultants</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <div class=\"stat-item__value\">14</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-item__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全球办公室</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Global Offices</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <div class=\"stat-item__value\">200+</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-item__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">企业客户</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Enterprise Clients</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <div class=\"stat-item__value\">8</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-item__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">行业覆盖</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Industry Verticals</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== CAPABILITIES ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"capabilities\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">核心能力</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Capabilities</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">智能驱动，代码落地</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Intelligence-Driven, Code-Proven</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"section-header__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">我们跨越战略咨询与技术实现的鸿沟。六大核心能力覆盖从蓝图到上线的全周期。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">We bridge the gap between strategic advisory and technical implementation. Six core capabilities cover the full lifecycle from blueprint to production.</span></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"filter-bar\" data-filter-target=\".card\">\n        <button class=\"filter-chip filter-chip--active\" data-filter=\"all\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全部</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">All</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"ai-strategy\">AI</button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"code-modernization\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">代码</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Code</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"operating-model\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">运营</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Ops</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"data-intelligence\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"cyber-resilience\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">安全</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Security</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"strategy-advisory\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Strategy</span></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-3\">\n        <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"ai-strategy\">\n          <div class=\"card__icon\">&#x1F9E0;</div>\n          <h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">AI 战略与转型</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">AI Strategy &amp; Transformation</span></h3>\n          <p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">从战略规划到落地执行，帮助企业构建 AI 原生竞争力。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">From strategic planning to execution, we help enterprises build AI-native competitiveness.</span></p>\n          <div class=\"card__subs\">\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">AI 成熟度评估</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">AI Maturity Assessment</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">生成式 AI 落地</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Generative AI Implementation</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">AI 治理与合规</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">AI Governance &amp; Compliance</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">机器学习平台</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">ML Platform Engineering</span></span>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"code-modernization\">\n          <div class=\"card__icon\">&#x2328;</div>\n          <h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">代码现代化</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Code Modernization</span></h3>\n          <p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">通过平台工程、架构演进和遗留系统改造，释放软件资产的长期价值。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Unlock the long-term value of software assets through platform engineering, architecture evolution, and legacy modernization.</span></p>\n          <div class=\"card__subs\">\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">平台工程</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Platform Engineering</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">遗留系统迁移</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Legacy System Migration</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">云原生架构</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Cloud-Native Architecture</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">DevSecOps 转型</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">DevSecOps Transformation</span></span>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"operating-model\">\n          <div class=\"card__icon\">&#x2699;</div>\n          <h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">运营模式设计</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Operating Model Design</span></h3>\n          <p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">重塑组织架构、流程与人才体系，使技术真正驱动业务增长。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Reshape organizational structure, processes, and talent systems so technology genuinely drives business growth.</span></p>\n          <div class=\"card__subs\">\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">技术组织设计</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Technology Org Design</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">敏捷与产品运营</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Agile &amp; Product Operations</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数字化人才战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Digital Talent Strategy</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">变革管理</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Change Management</span></span>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"data-intelligence\">\n          <div class=\"card__icon\">&#x1F4CA;</div>\n          <h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据智能</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data Intelligence</span></h3>\n          <p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">打通数据孤岛，构建可扩展的数据平台与智能决策体系。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Break down data silos, build scalable data platforms and intelligent decision-making systems.</span></p>\n          <div class=\"card__subs\">\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data Strategy</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据平台架构</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data Platform Architecture</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">高级分析</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Advanced Analytics</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据治理</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data Governance</span></span>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"cyber-resilience\">\n          <div class=\"card__icon\">&#x1F6E1;</div>\n          <h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">网络韧性</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Cyber Resilience</span></h3>\n          <p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">在日益复杂的威胁环境中，构建从预防到恢复的全周期安全能力。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Build full-cycle security capabilities from prevention to recovery in an increasingly complex threat landscape.</span></p>\n          <div class=\"card__subs\">\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">安全架构评估</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Security Architecture Assessment</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">零信任实施</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Zero Trust Implementation</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">事件响应</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Incident Response</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">合规与审计</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Compliance &amp; Audit</span></span>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"strategy-advisory\">\n          <div class=\"card__icon\">&#x1F9ED;</div>\n          <h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">战略咨询</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Strategy Advisory</span></h3>\n          <p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">结合行业洞察与技术视野，为企业制定可执行的数字化增长战略。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Combine industry insight with technology vision to craft executable digital growth strategies.</span></p>\n          <div class=\"card__subs\">\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数字化战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Digital Strategy</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">技术尽职调查</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Technology Due Diligence</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">创新蓝图</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Innovation Blueprint</span></span>\n            <span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">并购整合</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">M&amp;A Integration</span></span>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== SERVICE CATALOG ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section section--alt\" id=\"services\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">可销售服务</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Offerings</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">每个能力，具体到交付物与时间线</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Every Capability, Defined to Deliverables &amp; Timeline</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"section-header__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">以下是基于六大核心能力的精选服务产品。每个产品均明确定义了交付物、相关干系人与预期实现价值的时间。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Selected service offerings across our six core capabilities. Each is defined with clear deliverables, stakeholders, and expected time-to-value.</span></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-3\" id=\"service-grid\">\n        <!-- Populated by JS from service-catalog data -->\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== METHODOLOGY ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"methodology\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">方法论</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Methodology</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">六步闭环，从诊断到价值实现</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Six Steps from Diagnosis to Value Realization</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"section-header__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">每一个 Evoing 项目都遵循同一套经过验证的方法论。它不是线性流程，而是一个持续优化的闭环。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Every Evoing engagement follows the same proven methodology. It'\"'s not a linear process but a continuous improvement loop.</span></p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\\\"methodology-timeline\\\" id=\\\"methodology-timeline\\\">\n        <div class=\\\"methodology-step methodology-step--active\\\">\n          <div class=\\\"methodology-step__marker\\\">1</div>\n          <div class=\\\"methodology-step__content\\\">\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__phase\\\">Phase 1</p>\n            <h3 class=\\\"methodology-step__title\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">诊断</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Diagnose</span></h3>\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__summary\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">通过定量评估与利益相关方访谈，精准定位技术债务、组织瓶颈与 AI 就绪度差距。</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Pinpoint technical debt, organizational bottlenecks, and AI readiness gaps through quantitative assessment and stakeholder interviews.</span></p>\n            <div class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverables\\\">\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">现状评估报告</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Current-state assessment</span></span>\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">技术债务热力图</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Technical debt heatmap</span></span>\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">AI 成熟度评分卡</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">AI maturity scorecard</span></span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__duration\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">2–4 周</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">2–4 weeks</span></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\\\"methodology-step\\\">\n          <div class=\\\"methodology-step__marker\\\">2</div>\n          <div class=\\\"methodology-step__content\\\">\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__phase\\\">Phase 2</p>\n            <h3 class=\\\"methodology-step__title\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">战略</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Strategize</span></h3>\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__summary\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">将诊断洞察转化为可执行的路线图，明确投资优先级、能力建设路径与成功度量。</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Translate diagnostic insights into an executable roadmap with clear investment priorities, capability-building paths, and success metrics.</span></p>\n            <div class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverables\\\">\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">转型路线图</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Transformation roadmap</span></span>\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">投资优先级矩阵</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Investment matrix</span></span>\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">ROI 预测</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">ROI forecast</span></span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__duration\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">3–6 周</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">3–6 weeks</span></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\\\"methodology-step\\\">\n          <div class=\\\"methodology-step__marker\\\">3</div>\n          <div class=\\\"methodology-step__content\\\">\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__phase\\\">Phase 3</p>\n            <h3 class=\\\"methodology-step__title\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">原型</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Prototype</span></h3>\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__summary\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">以最小可行产品验证关键技术假设与业务价值，在真实环境中快速迭代。</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Validate key technical assumptions and business value with minimum viable products, iterating rapidly in real environments.</span></p>\n            <div class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverables\\\">\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">概念验证系统</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Proof-of-concept</span></span>\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">可行性评估</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Feasibility assessment</span></span>\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">规模化蓝图</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Scale-up blueprint</span></span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__duration\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">4–8 周</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">4–8 weeks</span></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\\\"methodology-step\\\">\n          <div class=\\\"methodology-step__marker\\\">4</div>\n          <div class=\\\"methodology-step__content\\\">\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__phase\\\">Phase 4</p>\n            <h3 class=\\\"methodology-step__title\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">工程交付</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Engineer</span></h3>\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__summary\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">以平台工程和 DevSecOps 实践规模化交付生产级系统，确保质量、安全与可观测性。</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Deliver production-grade systems at scale with platform engineering and DevSecOps practices, ensuring quality, security, and observability.</span></p>\n            <div class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverables\\\">\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">生产级平台</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Production platform</span></span>\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">CI/CD 流水线</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">CI/CD pipelines</span></span>\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">SRE 框架</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">SRE framework</span></span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__duration\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">8–16 周</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">8–16 weeks</span></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\\\"methodology-step\\\">\n          <div class=\\\"methodology-step__marker\\\">5</div>\n          <div class=\\\"methodology-step__content\\\">\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__phase\\\">Phase 5</p>\n            <h3 class=\\\"methodology-step__title\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">运营迁移</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Migrate</span></h3>\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__summary\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">通过结构化交接、知识转移与能力建设，确保客户团队能够自主运营新系统。</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Ensure client teams can independently operate new systems through structured handover, knowledge transfer, and capability building.</span></p>\n            <div class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverables\\\">\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">运营交接计划</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Handover plan</span></span>\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">团队培训</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Team training</span></span>\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">知识库</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Knowledge base</span></span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__duration\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">4–8 周</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">4–8 weeks</span></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\\\"methodology-step\\\">\n          <div class=\\\"methodology-step__marker\\\">6</div>\n          <div class=\\\"methodology-step__content\\\">\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__phase\\\">Phase 6</p>\n            <h3 class=\\\"methodology-step__title\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">价值实现</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Realize</span></h3>\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__summary\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">持续跟踪业务 KPI 与技术指标，通过季度回顾与优化建议确保投资回报。</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Continuously track business KPIs and technical metrics, ensuring return on investment through quarterly reviews and optimization recommendations.</span></p>\n            <div class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverables\\\">\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">价值仪表板</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Value dashboard</span></span>\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">季度回顾</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Quarterly review</span></span>\n              <span class=\\\"methodology-step__deliverable\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">优化建议</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Optimization recs</span></span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\\\"methodology-step__duration\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">持续</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Ongoing</span></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\\\"methodology-principles\\\">\n        <div class=\\\"methodology-principle\\\">\n          <p class=\\\"methodology-principle__label\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">代码即战略</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Code is Strategy</span></p>\n          <p class=\\\"methodology-principle__desc\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">软件架构决策本身就是商业战略决策，而非纯技术选择。</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Software architecture decisions are inherently business strategy decisions, not purely technical choices.</span></p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\\\"methodology-principle\\\">\n          <p class=\\\"methodology-principle__label\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">客户能力内建</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Build Client Capability</span></p>\n          <p class=\\\"methodology-principle__desc\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">我们的成功标准是客户团队不再需要我们——每一次交付都包含能力转移。</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Our success metric is when the client team no longer needs us — every engagement includes capability transfer.</span></p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\\\"methodology-principle\\\">\n          <p class=\\\"methodology-principle__label\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">指标驱动决策</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Metrics-Driven Decisions</span></p>\n          <p class=\\\"methodology-principle__desc\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">从诊断到价值实现，每个阶段都由可量化指标驱动，而非主观判断。</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">From diagnosis to value realization, every phase is driven by quantifiable metrics, not subjective judgment.</span></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <\"'!-- ========== CASE HIGHLIGHTS ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section section--dark\" id=\"cases\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">精选案例</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Case Highlights</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">交付成果，而非报告</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">We Deliver Outcomes, Not Decks</span></h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-3\">\n        <article class=\"case-card\">\n          <p class=\"case-card__industry\">Financial Services</p>\n          <h3 class=\"case-card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">某全球银行 AI 平台构建</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Global Bank AI Platform Build</span></h3>\n          <p class=\"case-card__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">为一家欧洲顶级银行设计并交付企业级 AI 平台，覆盖 12 个业务线，模型推理延迟降低 60%。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Designed and delivered an enterprise AI platform for a top European bank, covering 12 business lines with 60% lower model inference latency.</span></p>\n          <div class=\"case-card__metrics\">\n            <div><div class=\"case-card__metric-value\">60%</div><div class=\"case-card__metric-label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">推理延迟降低</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Latency Reduction</span></div></div>\n            <div><div class=\"case-card__metric-value\">12</div><div class=\"case-card__metric-label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">覆盖业务线</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Business Lines</span></div></div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"case-card\">\n          <p class=\"case-card__industry\">Retail &amp; Consumer</p>\n          <h3 class=\"case-card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">零售巨头云原生迁移</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Retail Giant Cloud-Native Migration</span></h3>\n          <p class=\"case-card__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">协助一家北美零售巨头将单体遗留系统迁移至云原生微服务架构，部署频率提升 8 倍。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Helped a North American retail giant migrate from monolith to cloud-native microservices, increasing deployment frequency 8x.</span></p>\n          <div class=\"case-card__metrics\">\n            <div><div class=\"case-card__metric-value\">8x</div><div class=\"case-card__metric-label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">部署频率提升</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Deploy Frequency</span></div></div>\n            <div><div class=\"case-card__metric-value\">99.99%</div><div class=\"case-card__metric-label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">系统可用性</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Availability</span></div></div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"case-card\">\n          <p class=\"case-card__industry\">Advanced Manufacturing</p>\n          <h3 class=\"case-card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">先进制造运营模式重塑</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Manufacturing Op Model Redesign</span></h3>\n          <p class=\"case-card__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">为一家中国先进制造企业重塑技术组织，从职能型结构转型为产品型组织，交付周期缩短 40%。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Reshaped the technology organization for a Chinese advanced manufacturer, transforming from functional to product-oriented structure, reducing delivery cycle by 40%.</span></p>\n          <div class=\"case-card__metrics\">\n            <div><div class=\"case-card__metric-value\">40%</div><div class=\"case-card__metric-label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">交付周期缩短</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Cycle Reduction</span></div></div>\n            <div><div class=\"case-card__metric-value\">+35%</div><div class=\"case-card__metric-label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">工程师满意度</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Eng. Satisfaction</span></div></div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== INDUSTRIES (with drill-down) ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"industries\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">行业专长</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Industries</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">深谙行业，才懂变革</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Deep Industry Knowledge Drives Real Change</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"section-header__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">点击任一行业卡片，深入了解痛点、我们的方法与可量化成果。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Click any industry card to explore pain points, our approach, and quantifiable outcomes.</span></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-4\" id=\"industries-grid\">\n        <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"financial-services\">\n          <span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">金融服务</span>\n          <span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Financial Services</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"retail-consumer\">\n          <span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">零售与消费品</span>\n          <span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Retail &amp; Consumer</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"healthcare\">\n          <span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">医疗健康</span>\n          <span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Healthcare</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"manufacturing\">\n          <span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">先进制造</span>\n          <span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Advanced Manufacturing</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"energy\">\n          <span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">能源与碳中和</span>\n          <span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Energy &amp; Net Zero</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"tmt\">\n          <span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">科技媒体电信</span>\n          <span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">TMT</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"public-sector\">\n          <span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">公共事业</span>\n          <span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Public Sector</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"automotive\">\n          <span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">汽车与出行</span>\n          <span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Automotive &amp; Mobility</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Industry drill-down panel -->\n      <div class=\"industry-detail\" id=\"industry-detail-panel\">\n        <div class=\"industry-detail__header\">\n          <h3 class=\"industry-detail__title\"></h3>\n          <button class=\"industry-detail__close\" aria-label=\"Close detail\">&times;</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"industry-detail__grid\">\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"industry-detail__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">核心痛点</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Key Pain Points</span></p>\n            <ul class=\"industry-detail__list industry-detail__pains\"></ul>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"industry-detail__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">Evoing 方法</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Evoing Approach</span></p>\n            <p class=\"industry-detail__approach\"></p>\n            <div class=\"industry-detail__caps\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"grid-column: 1 / -1;\">\n            <p class=\"industry-detail__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">预期成果</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Expected Outcomes</span></p>\n            <ul class=\"industry-detail__list industry-detail__outcomes\"></ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== GLOBAL PRESENCE ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section section--alt\" id=\"regions\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全球足迹</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Global Presence</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">三大洲 · 十四城</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Three Continents · Fourteen Cities</span></h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-3\">\n        <div class=\"region-card\">\n          <h3 class=\"region-card__name\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">亚太</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Asia-Pacific</span></h3>\n          <div class=\"region-card__cities\">\n            <span class=\"region-card__city region-card__city--hub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">新加坡</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Singapore</span></span>\n            <span class=\"region-card__city region-card__city--hub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">上海</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Shanghai</span></span>\n            <span class=\"region-card__city\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">东京</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Tokyo</span></span>\n            <span class=\"region-card__city\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">悉尼</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Sydney</span></span>\n            <span class=\"region-card__city\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">孟买</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Mumbai</span></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"region-card\">\n          <h3 class=\"region-card__name\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">欧洲、中东与非洲</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">EMEA</span></h3>\n          <div class=\"region-card__cities\">\n            <span class=\"region-card__city region-card__city--hub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">伦敦</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">London</span></span>\n            <span class=\"region-card__city region-card__city--hub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">迪拜</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Dubai</span></span>\n            <span class=\"region-card__city\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">柏林</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Berlin</span></span>\n            <span class=\"region-card__city\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">巴黎</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Paris</span></span>\n            <span class=\"region-card__city\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">约翰内斯堡</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Johannesburg</span></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"region-card\">\n          <h3 class=\"region-card__name\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">美洲</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Americas</span></h3>\n          <div class=\"region-card__cities\">\n            <span class=\"region-card__city region-card__city--hub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">纽约</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">New York</span></span>\n            <span class=\"region-card__city region-card__city--hub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">旧金山</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">San Francisco</span></span>\n            <span class=\"region-card__city\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">多伦多</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Toronto</span></span>\n            <span class=\"region-card__city\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">圣保罗</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">São Paulo</span></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== INSIGHTS (real content) ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section section--dark\" id=\"insights\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">洞见与研究</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Insights &amp; Research</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">思想领导力</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Thought Leadership</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"section-header__desc\" style=\"color:var(--color-slate-300);\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">来自全球团队的深度研究、行业分析与技术趋势洞察。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">In-depth research, industry analysis, and technology trend insights from our global team.</span></p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Category filter -->\n      <div class=\"filter-bar filter-bar--insight-cat\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--space-md);\">\n        <button class=\"filter-chip filter-chip--active\" data-filter=\"all\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全部主题</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">All Topics</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"ai-strategy\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">AI 战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">AI Strategy</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"code-modernization\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">代码现代化</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Code Modernization</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"operating-model\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">运营模式</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Operating Model</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"data-intelligence\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据智能</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data Intelligence</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"cyber-resilience\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">网络韧性</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Cyber Resilience</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"strategy-advisory\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">战略咨询</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Strategy Advisory</span></button>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Region filter -->\n      <div class=\"filter-bar filter-bar--insight-region\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--space-2xl);\">\n        <button class=\"filter-chip filter-chip--active\" data-filter=\"all\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全部地区</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">All Regions</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"global\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全球</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Global</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"apac\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">亚太</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">APAC</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"emea\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">欧洲中东非洲</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">EMEA</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"amer\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">美洲</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Americas</span></button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"insights-grid\" id=\"insights-grid\">\n        <!-- Populated by JS from insights.json data -->\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== LEADERSHIP ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"leadership\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">领导团队</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Leadership</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全球视野，本地深耕</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Global Perspective, Local Depth</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"section-header__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">我们的领导团队汇聚了来自麦肯锡、BCG、Google、Stripe、德意志银行等全球顶尖机构的战略家与工程师。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Our leadership team brings together strategists and engineers from McKinsey, BCG, Google, Stripe, Deutsche Bank, and other world-class institutions.</span></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"leadership-grid\" id=\"leadership-grid\">\n        <!-- Populated by JS from leadership.json data -->\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== CAREERS ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section section--alt\" id=\"careers\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">招贤纳士</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Careers</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">加入 Evoing</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Join Evoing</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"section-header__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">与全球顶尖的战略顾问和工程师一起定义智能与代码的未来。我们正在上海、新加坡、伦敦、纽约和迪拜招聘中高级顾问与工程师。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Define the future of intelligence and code alongside top strategists and engineers. We are hiring mid-to-senior consultants and engineers in Shanghai, Singapore, London, New York, and Dubai.</span></p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n        <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" data-target=\"contact\">\n          <span data-lang=\"zh\">联系我们了解更多</span>\n          <span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Contact Us to Learn More</span>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== CONTACT ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"contact\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"contact-grid\">\n        <div class=\"contact-info\">\n          <h2 class=\"contact-info__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">开启对话</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Start the Conversation</span></h2>\n          <p class=\"contact-info__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">无论您关注 AI 战略、代码现代化还是组织变革，我们的全球团队随时准备为您提供帮助。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Whether you'\"'re focused on AI strategy, code modernization, or organizational change, our global team is ready to help.</span></p>\n          <div class=\\\"contact-info__regions\\\">\n            <div class=\\\"contact-region\\\"><p class=\\\"contact-region__name\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">亚太</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Asia-Pacific</span></p><p class=\\\"contact-region__email\\\">apac@evoing.com</p></div>\n            <div class=\\\"contact-region\\\"><p class=\\\"contact-region__name\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">欧洲、中东与非洲</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">EMEA</span></p><p class=\\\"contact-region__email\\\">emea@evoing.com</p></div>\n            <div class=\\\"contact-region\\\"><p class=\\\"contact-region__name\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">美洲</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Americas</span></p><p class=\\\"contact-region__email\\\">amer@evoing.com</p></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <form class=\\\"contact-form\\\" id=\\\"contact-form\\\" novalidate>\n          <div class=\\\"contact-form__row\\\">\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2xs);\\\">\n              <input class=\\\"contact-form__input\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" required placeholder=\\\"Name / 姓名\\\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2xs);\\\">\n              <input class=\\\"contact-form__input\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" required placeholder=\\\"Email / 邮箱\\\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <input class=\\\"contact-form__input\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" name=\\\"company\\\" placeholder=\\\"Company / 公司\\\">\n          <select class=\\\"contact-form__input\\\" name=\\\"capability\\\">\n            <option value=\\\"\\\"><span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">选择感兴趣的能力</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Select Capability of Interest</span></option>\n            <option value=\\\"ai-strategy\\\">AI Strategy &amp; Transformation</option>\n            <option value=\\\"code-modernization\\\">Code Modernization</option>\n            <option value=\\\"operating-model\\\">Operating Model Design</option>\n            <option value=\\\"data-intelligence\\\">Data Intelligence</option>\n            <option value=\\\"cyber-resilience\\\">Cyber Resilience</option>\n            <option value=\\\"strategy-advisory\\\">Strategy Advisory</option>\n          </select>\n          <textarea class=\\\"contact-form__input contact-form__input--textarea\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" required placeholder=\\\"Message / 留言\\\"></textarea>\n          <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn btn--primary\\\">\n            <span data-lang=\\\"zh\\\">发送消息</span><span data-lang=\\\"en\\\" class=\\\"lang-hidden\\\">Send Message</span>\n          </button>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <\"'!-- ========== FOOTER ========== -->\n  <footer class=\"footer\" role=\"contentinfo\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"footer__grid\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"footer__brand\">Evoing</p>\n          <p class=\"footer__tagline\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">智能及代码，代码及智能。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Intelligence and Code, Code and Intelligence.</span></p>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"footer__col-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">导航</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Navigate</span></p>\n          <div class=\"footer__links\">\n            <a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"#capabilities\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">核心能力</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Capabilities</span></a>\n            <a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"#methodology\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">方法论</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Methodology</span></a>\n            <a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"#industries\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">行业专长</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Industries</span></a>\n            <a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"#insights\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">洞见</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Insights</span></a>\n            <a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"#careers\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">招贤纳士</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Careers</span></a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"footer__col-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">法律与社交</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Legal &amp; Social</span></p>\n          <div class=\"footer__links\">\n            <a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"#privacy\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">隐私政策</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Privacy Policy</span></a>\n            <a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"#terms\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">使用条款</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Terms of Use</span></a>\n    