< {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"agentMessage","id":"30ed68d1-6000-4545-b873-49b2877a106f","text":"## Round 2 Complete — Evoing Global Site Expansion\n\n**Validation:** 323/323 checks passed, zero failures.\n\n**First-party lines:** 4,196 (up from 2,615 in Round 1). Still below the 10,000 final target — on track.\n\n### New Files (14 added)\n\n| File | Lines | Purpose |\n|---|---|---|\n| `src/data/methodology.json` | 110 | 6-step engagement model with deliverables, durations, 3 principles |\n| `src/data/service-catalog.json` | 137 | 6 capabilities × 2–3 offerings each with deliverables, stakeholders, time-to-value |\n| `src/data/industry-deep.json` | 138 | 8 industries with pain points, Evoing approach, outcomes, capability refs |\n| `src/data/insights.json` | 102 | 10 bilingual articles with category, region, reading time, authors |\n| `src/data/leadership.json` | 92 | 9 global leaders with bios, expertise, languages, locations |\n| `src/css/methodology.css` | 178 | Alternating timeline layout, active step marker, 3-column principles |\n| `src/css/insights.css` | 110 | Article card grid, meta badges, reading time, dual filter bars |\n| `src/css/industry-detail.css` | 153 | Drill-down panel with pain/approach/outcomes grid, close button |\n| `src/css/leadership.css` | 84 | 3-column leader cards with expertise tags, languages |\n| `src/js/insights.js` | 57 | Multi-axis filtering by category + region on insight cards |\n| `src/js/contact.js` | 101 | Email validation, inline error messages, toast notification |\n| `src/js/methodology.js` | 33 | IntersectionObserver-driven step activation on scroll |\n| `src/js/industry-detail.js` | 135 | Click-to-open drill-down panel with JSON-driven population |\n| `src/css/main.css` | +10 | Now imports 4 new CSS modules; added toast + error styles |\n\n### Updated Files\n\n- `src/index.html` — added methodology timeline section, service catalog grid, industry drill-down panel, real insights grid with dual filter bars, leadership grid, updated contact form with `name` attributes and validation hooks. Nav now links Methodology.\n- `src/js/main.js` — grew from 55 to 255 lines; now fetches and renders service catalog, insights, leadership, and industry-deep data client-side from JSON endpoints.\n- `scripts/validate.mjs` — grew from 251 to 324 lines; validates all new data files, cross-references (industry↔capability, insight↔category, leader↔region), CSS imports, JS module hooks, and new HTML sections.\n\n### New Interactions\n\n- **Methodology timeline** — scroll-driven step activation; active step gets gold-filled marker with glow ring\n- **Service catalog** — 16 concrete offerings rendered from JSON with stakeholders, deliverables, TTV\n- **Industry drill-down** — clicking any industry card opens a panel showing 4 pain points, Evoing approach with styled blockquote, 3 quantified outcomes, and related capability tags\n- **Insight dual filtering** — independent category and region filter bars work together (AND logic)\n- **Contact validation** — required name/email/message checks, email regex, per-field inline errors that clear on input, toast on success\n- **Leadership profiles** — 9 cards with bilingual bios, expertise tags, language indicators\n\n### Start & Validate\n\n```\nnpm start       → http://0.0.0.0:5173\nnpm test        → 323 checks (files, JSON, HTML, CSS, JS, business rules)\n```\n\n### Next Round Gaps\n\n- First-party lines at 4,196; need ~5,800 more. Bulk of remaining content should go into dedicated sub-pages (not more sections on index.html)\n- Cases need expansion from 3 to 8–10, each with full narrative\n- Insights could grow to 20+ articles with detail pages\n- Regions need individual office pages with local leadership, case studies, service focus\n- Careers should list actual open roles with structured data\n- Privacy/Terms pages are stubs\n- sitemap.xml, robots.txt, and PWA manifest not yet present\n- No image assets (all icons are emoji/SVG inline)","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},"threadId":"019e2ff1-213e-7f10-918e-56ff4313a1e6","turnId":"019e3004-e1ce-7ef2-ba78-b511b980a382","completedAtMs":1778923522065}}
